      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-21T18:14:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You may choose to wait as long as you want to destroy Obsidian Field.  You could leave it out all game.  Any play may choose to discard two cards to get rid of it - the “must” indicates that <span class=\"bbcode-b\">two card</span> must be discarded for Obsidian Field to be destroyed.</p>",
